    "Starts the taskbar meter when you sign in.": "登录 Windows 后自动启动任务栏网速显示。",
    "Also shows SpeedMeter in the notification area.": "同时在通知区域显示 SpeedMeter 图标。",
    "Colors for this window. The taskbar meter follows the taskbar.": "设置此窗口的颜色；任务栏网速显示跟随任务栏主题。",
